sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request CSMS to set data for:<br>- OCPPCommCtrlr.OfflineThreshold<br>- AuthCtrlr.AuthorizeRemoteStart
    CSMS->>CS: SetVariablesRequest (setVariableData: OCPPCommCtrlr.OfflineThreshold = "123", AuthCtrlr.AuthorizeRemoteStart = "false")
    Note over CSMS: Validation: SetVariablesRequest with (in arbitrary order):<br>setVariableData[1]:<br>- variable.name = "OfflineThreshold"<br>- component.name = "OCPPCommCtrlr"<br>- attributeValue = "123"<br>- attributeType is absent or attributeType = Actual<br>setVariableData[2]:<br>- variable.name = "AuthorizeRemoteStart"<br>- component.name = "AuthCtrlr"<br>- attributeValue = "false"<br>- attributeType is absent or attributeType = Actual

    CS-->>CSMS: SetVariablesResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: Manually validate that CSMS has correctly set the requested variables
